      "id": "REQ-QUIC-RFC9287-S3-0001",
      "title": "Advertise grease_quic_bit as an empty transport parameter",
      "statement": "An endpoint that implements RFC 9287 version 1 greasing MUST send grease_quic_bit (0x2ab2) as an empty transport parameter.",
